        FallbackChatGenerationService is a decorator: it depends on the
        concrete Model\Chat\ChatGenerationService class (not this interface)
        to reach the undecorated, primary-only implementation without a DI
        cycle. CostTrackingChatGenerationService decorates it the same way
        (depends on the concrete FallbackChatGenerationService class) to add
        LLM cost-cap usage tracking on top. Every existing caller of
        ChatGenerationServiceInterface (ChatEntryPipeline, PlaygroundQueryRunner,
        tests) gets retry/circuit-breaker/fallback AND usage tracking
        transparently with no code change on their side.
    -->
